on enterFrame
  [  0] getmovieprop 120 ........................ <the movieName>
  [  3] pushcons 0 .............................. <"hotel">
  [  5] containsstr ............................. <the movieName contains "hotel">
  [  6] jmpifz [ 33] ............................ if the movieName contains "hotel" then
  [  9] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 11] extcall 27 .............................. peoplefunk()
  [ 13] pushint8 30 ............................. <30>
  [ 16] pusharglist 1 ........................... <30>
  [ 18] extcall 12 .............................. <sprite(30)>
  [ 20] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 21] setobjprop 13 ........................... sprite(30).visible = 0
  [ 23] pushint8 30 ............................. <30>
  [ 26] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 29] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <30, 1>
  [ 31] extcall 31 .............................. puppetSprite(30, 1)
  [ 33] ret
end
